This release differs from v2.1 in:

1. Removed all the writer count and associated semaphore locking which
   occurred when messages were queued for output. This was all superfluous!

2. Modified purge() which had a bug relevant to the removed writer count
   code (an a failed status could have been returned when everything was ok)

3. Modified processOutputResponse() so it was backwards compatible with
   the pre release 2.0 mods (I had broken it).

4. Repaired processStringResponse() so it was backwards compatible with
   the pre release 2.0 mods (it too was broken).

Thanks to the people who fedback the problems.

AH
